# SpoolNet Electrical Hardware & Wiring

SpoolNet consists of two ESP32-S3-based devices:

* **Tracking Hub** — measures filament usage and identifies the active spool.
* **Location Unit** — identifies spool locations and provides RGB status feedback.

Both devices communicate with the SpoolNet server over Wi-Fi.

## Tracking Hub

### Components

* ESP32-S3FH4R2
* MT6701 magnetic encoder
* PN532 NFC reader
* SSD1306 128×64 OLED
* Filament drive wheel/gear + magnet
* Status LED
* 3.3 V power regulation
* USB-C power input
* Decoupling capacitors and required resistors

### Pinout

#### I²C — OLED + MT6701

| Signal | ESP32-S3 |
| ------ | -------: |
| SCL    |   GPIO 2 |
| SDA    |   GPIO 6 |
| VCC    |    3.3 V |
| GND    |      GND |

The OLED and MT6701 share the same I²C bus.

#### SPI — PN532

| PN532 | ESP32-S3 |
| ----- | -------: |
| SCK   |   GPIO 8 |
| MISO  |  GPIO 12 |
| MOSI  |   GPIO 7 |
| SS    |  GPIO 11 |
| VCC   |    3.3 V |
| GND   |      GND |

The PN532 is configured for SPI communication.


