## Location Unit

### Components

* ESP32-S3FH4R2
* PN532 NFC reader
* RGB LED
* 3× current-limiting resistors
* 3.3 V power regulation
* USB-C power input
* Decoupling capacitors

### PN532 SPI Pinout

| PN532 | ESP32-S3 |
| ----- | -------: |
| SCK   |  GPIO 11 |
| MISO  |  GPIO 12 |
| MOSI  |   GPIO 6 |
| SS    |  GPIO 13 |
| VCC   |    3.3 V |
| GND   |      GND |

### RGB LED

| LED Channel | ESP32-S3 |
| ----------- | -------: |
| Red         |   GPIO 1 |
| Green       |   GPIO 5 |
| Blue        |   GPIO 2 |

Each RGB channel requires its own current-limiting resistor.

