## Power

The primary power architecture is:

```text
USB-C / 5 V
     │
     ▼
Power Protection / Regulation
     │
     ▼
   3.3 V
     │
     ├── ESP32-S3
     ├── PN532
     ├── MT6701
     └── SSD1306
```

All primary logic peripherals operate at **3.3 V**.

